msgid ""
"The ten-foot interface: your Steam library, Big Picture and the machine's "
"own switches as tiles, drivable from a game controller."
msgstr ""
"दूर से चलाने वाला इंटरफ़ेस: आपकी Steam लाइब्रेरी, Big Picture और मशीन के अपने स्विच "
