msgid "The visualizer needs projectM — synpkg install projectm-pulseaudio"
msgstr "विज़ुअलाइज़र को projectM चाहिए — synpkg install projectm-pulseaudio"

msgid ""
"Tiles on the media shelf. They open in your browser as their own full-screen "
